# ---- the drawn-weapon LOCO (P2b production, FOLK-BODY): `guard`, hung on the guard arm's `grip` mark (arms/adult/loco
# man_r / woman_r key guard), so the blade rides the body's bob, lean and breathe. The fist is the arm's: these grids leave
# it clear (the hand drawn over the grip, STYLE_P2 5). R and L are A3's recover blade (r3 / l3: with the guard arm they
